00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:22.260
And, a lot of people ask me like how I deal with it

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:25.660
Considering I am like the lightning conduit of HATE on the internet

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:28.260
And... I'm totally fine with that. I don't mind it at all.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:33.100
Uh, because...when I started on YouTube obviously when my first, video,

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:37.080
Uh, i-it went like "viral" on reddit, it got like number 3

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:40.160
