00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:36.600
A-and that like, crafted my philosophy on how I deal with hate

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.160
Uh, (muffled) on the internet

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:40.020
And most of it, is just...

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.000
You gotta ignore the majority of it,

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.240
Because the majority of it is just mindless hate.

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:46.760
Coming from nowhere, from people trying to poke bears

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:49.620
Wherever they can poke, and they get joy out of getting response

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:53.000
And that's, fine, that's the internet, that's life,

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:56.740
But... when that comes AT you, a lot of people don't know how to deal with it

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:59.380
Because, uh-like because you guys are good-natured people.

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:05.980
MOST people are good-natured people, and, it's WEIRD that someone would randomly want to throw hate at you

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:09.360
So the natural inclination is to try to fix the problem,

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.100
Which is an admirable response,

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:14.140
I don't DIMINISH that response in any way,

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:16.560
Uh, but as far as my advice goes,

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:18.720
If you do that, if you don't, it doesn't matter

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:20.080
It's whatever you choose to do

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:23.240
But, my mindset when I approach hate IS...

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:24.800
These people

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:29.800
The, anonymous hate on the internet, they don't know who YOU are as a PERSON.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:34.500
They don't know the experiences that YOU have been through individually.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.340
They don't know what you've gone through.

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:37.940
They don't don't know the pain of your life.

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:39.360
They don't know the JOYS of your life.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:42.820
They know next to NOTHING, except what you have PUT,

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:45.980
Which is a narrow sliver of your life on the internet.

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:50.560
So... that, narrow, image is all they base their hate on.

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:53.140
And therefore, they don't actually KNOW you.

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:56.060
And therefore, they don't have any RIGHT,

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.260
To HATE,

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:00.920
On You. Your life isn't influence by that at ALL.

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:03.360
Because, they don't understand who you ARE.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.280
Now, if this was coming from a FRIEND,

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:07.660
If I got a friend of mine,(if)

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:13.020
That came up to me and told me I was a HORRIBLE person and I was just being awful,

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:14.820
And what I was doing was wrong,

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:18.920
And I should just GIVE up, and GO home and not do it EVER again.

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:22.480
THAT would affect me, like that would affect me because MY friends,

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:25.200
and the people that I keep in my life, are people that I TRUST.

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:28.780
Very much so. And that trust means I trust their opinion.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:31.140
(yelling) BUT ANONYMOUS PEOPLE ON THE INTERNET?

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:32.980
