00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:36.720
Especially if they're anonymous.

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:39.240
Now, I-I'm not diminishing internet friends at all,

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:41.880
You can have internet friends and people that you trust on the internet.

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:44.520
