00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:57.200
Because... I make my videos, for anyone who wants to make my videos,

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:59.480
I do my things for anyone that wants to,

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:04.040
I don't MAKE IT FOR them, they are ALLOWED to not like my videos,

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:11.440
They are allowed, to take THAT, and keep it with themselves, because I honestly,

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:17.660
Am OKAY with them not liking my videos, I'm honestly okay with them not enjoying what I put in front of them

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:20.120
Because that's the narrow sliver that they SEE.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.640
And if they disagree with that narrow sliver,

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.840
THAT'S TOTALLY FINE!

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:26.820
I AM 100 PERCENT OKAY WITH THAT!

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:29.340
(yelling) THEY CAN DO WHATEEEVER THEY WANT.

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:31.520
Like seriously. They are their own person.

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:35.180
Even though they may seem from an anonymous perspective, like they're just a random,

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:39.600
(deep voice) Somebody. But they're a random whoooever. I-it really doesn't matter.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:44.340
So, they're allowed... to take whatever small view they have of you,

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:47.420
And I'm not saying they're narrow-minded, a lot of them are, but I'm not saying they are.

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:49.640
I'm saying they only see... a part of you...

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:53.400
So you can either try to show them all of you,

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:55.420
And most likely they won't listen but,

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:57.340
You can try to show them all of you,

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:01.480
Or, you can try to keep putting out the best of you, possible.

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:07.780
And that best of you is the best that you can possibly make the best that you can possibly do right now,

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:09.680
That is the best you're doing.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.740
And you do that every day and eventually,

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:17.920
You'll start to find people, that do enjoy... that, sliver of who you are.

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:19.420
And when they enjoy that,

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:22.760
Then they wanna know more, and then they open themselves up

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:26.480
